          "pmid": 41914769,
          "citation": "PMID 41914769",
          "claim": "This resulted in a variant of interest in KCNA2 : Chr1(GRCh37):g.111146452C>T ENST00000485317:c.953G>A (p.Gly318Asp).\npcDNA3 plasmids containing human K V 1.2 with an N\u2010terminally fused enhanced green fluorescent protein (EGFP) or a monomeric red fluorescent protein (mRFP1) tag and an extracellular haemagglutinin (HA) site (between transmembrane helices S1 and S2, as applicable) were used; these constructs were synthesized as described previously (Nilsson et al., 2022 )."
